<title>INDONESIA: Mulia 9-mth net almost doubles.</title>
<headline>Mulia 9-mth net almost doubles.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   80.00 vs 41.27</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)   154 vs 205</p>
<p>    Revenue			     355.51 vs 210.03</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   97.18 vs 62.47</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Mulia Industrindo is a ceramic and glass manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
